+## Phase 8 sample cost and delivery additions
+
+Sample adds nullable courierName/courierTrackingNumber (courier_name/courier_tracking_number) and a status/createdAt/id queue index. Existing quoteRefundPolicy stores full/partial/none. Buyer acceptance creates a sampling Order linked uniquely by sampleId in the same transaction as the decision. Administrative sample notes and actor IDs are excluded from requester/sample-order views. Apply the reviewed shared migration before regenerating clients.
