+## Phase 8 sample acceptance integration
+
+Existing buyer and supplier-requester sample decision routes retain their public payload. Acceptance now checks ownership and quote expiry under a sample row lock, validates the approved fulfillment supplier, and atomically creates one PENDING_PAYMENT sampling Order and initial milestone. An order creation failure rolls back acceptance; duplicate/conflicting decisions return 409. Sample detail/list/decision and requester order projections withhold quoteInternalNotes. Requester sample pages display refund policy and courier tracking when recorded.
